# Optional Albert API settings (never commit real keys).
# Copy to .env.local when developing generative anonymization.
#
# VITE_ALBERT_API_KEY=sk-...
# Local Vite uses /albert-api (proxy in vite.config.js). Override only if needed:
# VITE_ALBERT_BASE_URL=/albert-api/v1
#
# GitHub Pages builds use the Cloudflare Worker CORS proxy by default
# (see src/lib/albertConstants.js → ALBERT_CORS_PROXY_BASE_URL).
# Override in CI with repository variable VITE_ALBERT_BASE_URL if the Worker URL changes.
